      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Jumping on this, we posted over on ask.vrc, only thought about checking feedback.vrc and found the same post. If you still need logs I'm happy to send them. I've tried with a vpn, I've tried regenerating id's, tried logging out and back in, I can upload the world, edit the description but if I try to upload a new thumbnail I get, \"File already uploaded, 500 internal error, application error\" I've found that the images are uploading because when I use vrcx I have them as an option to pick from but it won't change the thumbnail even with that. https://ask.vrchat.com/t/i-get-an-application-error-whenever-i-try-to-update-the-thumbnail-for-my-world/44249/4",
